Subject: Re: Distance analysis question on nested design.
Message-ID: <KXm_CKpog9s.02weB-xT6wEJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <KXm_CKpog9s.CLNPttMHovMJ@distance-sampling.groups.google.com>
